      "source": "```swift\nlet stride = vDSP_Stride(1)\n\nlet a: [Float] = [10, 20, 30, 40, 50]\nlet b: [Float] = [ 1,  2,  3,  4,  5]\n\nlet n = vDSP_Length(a.count)\n\nvar c = [Float](repeating: 0,\n                count: a.count)\n\nvDSP_vmul(b, stride,\n          a, stride,\n          &c, stride,\n          n)\n\n// Prints \"[10.0, 40.0, 90.0, 160.0, 250.0]\".\nprint(c)\n```",
